       <div class="card-name">Zodiac Cipher (Z-340)</div>
       <p class="card-desc">The Zodiac Killer's 340-character cipher baffled the FBI, NSA, and amateur codebreakers for 51 years. In 2020, David Oranchak, Sam Blake, and Jarl Van Eycke finally cracked it — revealing a homophonic substitution with irregular transposition.</p>
